            "sid": "GEN 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Rasheli amaze kubyara Yosefu, Yakobo abwira Labani ati “Nsezerera ngende, njye iwacu mu gihugu cyacu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpa abagore banjye n'abana banjye nagutenderagaho nigendere, kuko uzi gutenda nagutenzeho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani aramubwira ati “Icyampa nkakugiriraho umugisha! Kuko nahanuye yuko ari ku bwawe Uwiteka yampereye umugisha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ati “Nca ibihembo nzaguha, nzajya mbitanga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aramusubiza ati “Uzi uko nagutenzeho, kandi uko amatungo yawe yabaye nyaragira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko ayo wari ufite ntaraza yari make, none yarororotse aba menshi cyane. Uwiteka yaguhaye umugisha aho naganaga hose, none nzabona ryari ibitungisha urwanjye rugo?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aramubaza ati “Nzaguhemba iki?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo aramusubiza ati “Nta cyo uzampemba, ahubwo nunkorera iki, nzongera nkuragirire umukumbi, nywurinde. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uyu munsi ndaca mu mukumbi wawe wose, nkuremo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "nkuremo:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "cyangwa, nawe ukuremo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " intama z'ubugondo zose n'iz'ibitobo zose n'intama z'ibikara zose, n'ihene z'ibitobo n'iz'ubugondo, izimeze zityo zizaba ibihembo byanjye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gukiranuka kwanjye kuzamburanira gutya hanyuma: nuza kwitegereza ibihembo byanjye biri imbere yawe, ihene yose itari ubugondo cyangwa igitobo, n'intama yose itari igikara nizimbonekaho, uzazite inyibano.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani aramusubiza ati “Nkunze ko byaba bityo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko uwo munsi arobanura amapfizi y'ihene y'ibihuga, n'inyagazi z'ubugondo n'iz'ibitobo zose, ihene yose ifite ibara ry'umweru, n'intama z'ibikara zose, aziha abahungu be. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hagati yabo na Yakobo ahashyira urugendo rw'iminsi itatu. Yakobo aragira imikumbi ya Labani isigaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo yenda uduti tw'imilebeni tubisi, n'utw'imiluzi n'utw'imyarumoni, adushishuraho amabara maremare asa n'imisengo, agaragaza umweru wo kuri two. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashyira uduti yashishuye ku bibumbiro byo ku mabuga aho imikumbi iri bunywere. Zarindaga uko zije kunywa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imikumbi yarindiraga imbere y'utwo duti, zikabyara iz'ibihuga n'iz'ubugondo n'iz'ibitobo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo akarobanura izivutse, akerekeranya izo mu mukumbi wa Labani n'iz'ibihuga n'iz'ibikara, agashyira imikumbi ye ukwayo, ntayiteranye n'iya Labani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi uko inziza zo mu mukumbi zirinze, Yakobo yashyiraga twa duti ku bibumbiro imbere y'umukumbi, kugira ngo zitēgere hagati yatwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko zaba mbi ntadushyireho, bituma imbi ziba iza Labani, inziza zikaba iza Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 30:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo mugabo agwiza ubutunzi cyane, agira imikumbi myinshi n'abaja n'abagaragu, n'ingamiya n'indogobe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.30.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.30.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
